      "id": "p1",
      "text": "After a long, dogged investigation that refused to back down, enforcers who stand up for fair play are finalizing a decisive blow against market abuse. The tech giant rigging the field is set to face a landmark fine, a major financial penalty, for years of rule-breaking that demands accountability. The verdict will land before the break, marking a victory for open competition in the EU.",
