    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The guardians of the market arena have stood firm, dismissing inadequate fixes from the gatekeeper abusing its dominant position. Under the gatekeeper regulation, a decision is expected soon in Brussels, the front line of the enforcement battle. This action aims to protect market competitors who were squeezed out by the tech giant's self-preferencing in search results.",
