    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "European authorities are delivering a powerful response to the technology company that tilted the playing field. A decisive blow against market abuse is being finalized, a major financial penalty adding to a history of competition fines. This action on the front line of the enforcement battle is designed to protect open competition and ensure fair play for underdogs.",
